  "contract": [
    "Serpent Lord's Ritual 706018 gives the player's own direct heals a 5% chance (DBC ProcChance, rolled in",
    "Chance()) to cast Serpent Lord's Amulet 800914 for 5 sec. That triggered cast has no server cooldown, but its",
    "SMSG_SPELL_GO makes the client start the Amulet's 90 sec RecoveryTime, so the button showed a cooldown the",
    "server does not have. Expected: after the Ritual's cast the client shows the Amulet ready.",
    "The 5% roll cannot be forced from a scenario, so the player is set to 1 health and casts Heal 1000",
    "(TEST) 49 on itself 200 times: P(no proc) = 0.95^200 = 3.5e-5. spell_go_count proves the client received the cast."
  ],
